# Sonic Advance 2 from power-on: language (A), name (a letter, START, A), SEGA, title, GAME START, Sonic, Leaf Forest 1.
# SA2-1 logo through the menus; SA2-2 the zone card taken onto the bottom screen; SA2-3/4 the HUD moved down.
wait 240
press A 6
wait 120
press A 6
wait 60
press START 6
wait 60
press A 6
wait 1000
shot a-title
press START 6
wait 120
shot b-menu
press A 6
wait 120
shot c-menu2
press A 6
wait 120
shot d-select
press A 6
# the zone card: shots all the way through it (the bottom takes the card once it settles, ~2 s in)
wait 30
shot e-card0
wait 40
shot e-card1
wait 40
shot e-card2
wait 40
shot e-card3
wait 60
shot e-card4
wait 100
shot f-start
wait 100
shot g-level
hold RIGHT 200
wait 30
shot h-level-moved
hold RIGHT 300
wait 30
shot i-level-later
